                <h1 class="hero-title">Full-Stack<br>Developer</h1>

                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    Building exceptional digital experiences with modern technologies.
                    Specialized in React, Node.js, and cloud architecture with a passion
                    for creating scalable, user-centric applications.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-meta-grid">
                    <div class="meta-card">
                        <div class="meta-label">Focus</div>
                        <span class="meta-value">Front-End-APIs</span>
                        <div class="meta-caption">React-style patterns & UX</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="meta-card">
                        <div class="meta-label">Projects</div>
                        <span class="meta-value">
                                    <%= projects.length %>+
                                </span>
                        <div class="meta-caption">UI, API & full-stack experiments</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="meta-card">
                        <div class="meta-label">Background</div>
                        <span class="meta-value">Data & System</span>
                        <div class="meta-caption">Bringing analytics into web apps</div>
                    </div>
                </div>


            </div>

            <div class="hero-right">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
                        <h3 class="card-title">what I'm building here</h3>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li>Movie & book libraries with real catalog UX</li>
                        <li>Dashboard-style layouts with filters and popovers</li>
                        <li>API-driven apps (maps, Books, and movie data)</li>
                        <li>Experimenting with authentication & theming</li>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="tech-stack">
                        <div class="stack-label">Tech Stack</div>
                        <div class="stack-pills">
                            <span class="pill">HTML</span>
                            <span class="pill">CSS</span>
                            <span class="pill">JavaScript</span>
                            <span class="pill">Node.js</span>
                            <span class="pill">Express</span>
                            <span class="pill">EJS</span>
                            <span class="pill">REST APIs</span>
                            <span class="pill">React</span>
                            <span class="pill">TypeScript</span>
                            <span class="pill">PostgresSQL</span>
                            <span class="pill">Machine Learning</span>
                            <span class="pill">AI Prompt Engineering</span>
                            <span class="pill">Coding With AI</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-section">
        <div class="stats-grid">
